{{!-- Rendered whenever an Attack roll snapshotted an attacker (attackerUuid,
      see module/dice/dice.mjs's CarlDice.rollAttack) - lets a THIRD-PARTY
      crawler (Taunt, Interrupt Action, Carl RPG p.81) roll an INT-Opposed
      Taunt Skill Check against the attacking Mob and redirect this specific
      Attack onto themselves. The button's click handler and one-shot
      gating are wired up client-side by the shared registerChatListener
      (module/chat/chat-listener.mjs), via this button's data-action and
      taunt-card.mjs's tauntActionEntries - not baked into this markup. --}}
<div class="carl-taunt-link">
  <button type="button" class="carl-taunt-attack" data-action="tauntAttack">
    <i class="fas fa-bullhorn"></i> {{localize "CARLRPG.Taunt.RollButton"}}
  </button>
</div>
